    "title": "KAVA token sinks 40% as exploit hits Kava Lend, exchanges halt withdrawals",
    "summary": "The exploit highlights vulnerabilities in DeFi systems, potentially undermining trust and prompting stricter security measures across platforms.\nThe post KAVA token sinks 40% as exploit hits Kava Lend, exchanges halt withdrawals appeared first on Crypto Briefing.",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://cryptobriefing.com/kava-token-incident-bridge-shutdown/",
    "source": "CryptoBriefing",
    "tags": [
      "Kava",
